      en: ["Founded in 1543 by Spanish colonizers", "The Santiago Apóstol Church dates back to 1693", "Conchagua Volcano reaches an elevation of 1,225 meters", "The town celebrates its patronal festival every July", "Located in the La Unión department near the Pacific coast", "Houses significant archaeological traces of the Lenca culture"],
