      en: ["The closest city to Cerro El Pital, the highest peak (2,730 m).", "Key production center for strawberries and blackberries in the country.", "Located in the Chalatenango department by the Honduras border.", "Known for having one of the coldest climates in El Salvador.", "A primary destination for mountain climbing and camping.", "The city was named in honor of Saint Ignatius of Loyola."],
