      en: ["Chilanga is situated at an elevation of approximately 380 meters.", "The name is a term from the nearly extinct Lenca language.", "The municipality covers an area of about 34.36 square kilometers.", "Historically, the region was known for the extraction of textile fibers.", "The patron saint of the town is the Virgin of the Immaculate Conception.", "Chilanga belongs to the Gotera district in the eastern part of the country."],
